WEBVTT

00:03.420 --> 00:04.796
[Si-eun] I asked a favor.

00:05.714 --> 00:06.840
I said to stop.

00:13.013 --> 00:14.014
[students exclaiming]

00:14.889 --> 00:16.016
[Su-ho] Nope, nope.

00:16.599 --> 00:19.811
Let's not cross the line, hmm?
Enough is enough.

00:23.523 --> 00:24.649
You next?

00:24.733 --> 00:28.278
Me? Nah,
you just woke up a guardian angel.

00:29.863 --> 00:31.489
[Si-eun] Unconditioned reflex.

00:31.573 --> 00:33.700
An innate, automatic response
to a stimulus,

00:33.783 --> 00:37.245
such as closing one's eyes unconsciously
when an object suddenly appears.

00:40.498 --> 00:42.459
- [students exclaiming]
- [Su-ho] Damn it.

00:43.793 --> 00:45.420
Cut it out, crazy man.

00:46.004 --> 00:47.589
I'll have to hit you if you don't. Hmm?

00:51.676 --> 00:53.803
[sighs] You should've stopped when I said.

00:55.138 --> 00:57.057
Who are you to tell me what to do?

00:57.849 --> 00:59.517
[tense music playing]

01:05.774 --> 01:07.484
[teacher] What are you two doing?

01:07.567 --> 01:08.526
[silence]

01:16.367 --> 01:17.702
Put… put the chair down!

01:18.620 --> 01:20.663
How could you even think
of doing this in class?

01:21.498 --> 01:23.041
Let me explain, ma'am.

01:23.124 --> 01:25.168
I was trying to break up
my friends' fight.

01:25.752 --> 01:27.962
But then, I almost fell over this chair.

01:28.046 --> 01:29.631
I'm really sorry.

01:30.423 --> 01:31.716
[sighs] Apologize to her.

01:35.970 --> 01:37.180
Come on, hurry!

01:40.558 --> 01:42.560
[gentle ambient music playing]

01:44.104 --> 01:45.814
[Si-eun breathing heavily]

01:55.031 --> 01:56.658
[breathing echoing]

02:03.998 --> 02:06.000
["Hero" by Meego playing]

02:20.515 --> 02:25.645
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

03:18.656 --> 03:20.074
[siren blaring]

03:20.158 --> 03:22.076
JEONGJIN SEOUL HOSPITAL

03:22.160 --> 03:25.538
[teacher] Yes.
We just got to the hospital.

03:28.541 --> 03:29.918
Yes, I'll talk to her.

03:31.711 --> 03:33.004
Please don't worry.

03:34.339 --> 03:35.715
I'll call you later.

03:37.175 --> 03:38.801
[woman] You're here by yourself?

03:39.719 --> 03:42.388
- I'm sorry, ma'am. Please calm down.
- I told you to bring your mom.

03:42.472 --> 03:43.723
So why did you show up alone?

03:46.267 --> 03:49.479
- I apologize.
- Bring your mom. Don't apologize instead.

03:51.648 --> 03:52.732
I don't have one.

03:53.274 --> 03:55.526
[scoffs] Oh, I don't believe you.

03:55.610 --> 04:00.365
Listen, I am going to make sure you get
put into a detention center. Got it?

04:04.202 --> 04:06.204
[tense music playing]

04:06.829 --> 04:08.957
Today, Yeong-bin made another student

04:10.124 --> 04:11.417
stick this on my neck.

04:12.418 --> 04:13.586
[mother] What is that?

04:14.754 --> 04:16.297
Ah, well, it's…

04:16.381 --> 04:18.841
A narcotic. Drugs.

04:20.677 --> 04:22.387
[Yeong-bin] You're fucking lying.

04:23.054 --> 04:26.432
Where's your proof? Do you have
evidence that I fucking did it?

04:27.100 --> 04:28.810
You're really unobservant, aren't you?

04:29.560 --> 04:30.937
- Isn't this your backpack?
- [unzips]

04:34.065 --> 04:38.069
FENTANYL PATCHES

04:44.701 --> 04:48.079
[teacher] You do understand,
addressing the fight isn't the issue here.

04:50.206 --> 04:53.209
Yeong-bin will need to be transferred
to another school.

04:56.212 --> 05:00.008
If this were to be publicized, it would…

05:01.426 --> 05:03.594
It's best to let it go quietly.

05:05.930 --> 05:06.931
[mother sighs]

05:18.526 --> 05:20.528
[door lock keypad bleeping]

05:21.946 --> 05:23.573
[TV playing softly]

05:26.576 --> 05:27.910
[bleeping]

05:33.791 --> 05:35.001
[father] There's my kid.

05:36.085 --> 05:38.087
Si-eun-a, what happened to your hand?

05:39.088 --> 05:41.257
Oh, I got hurt during PE.

05:42.425 --> 05:43.468
[father] Let me see.

05:46.137 --> 05:47.513
You didn't faint again, did you?

05:48.514 --> 05:50.683
No, I haven't in a while.

06:00.568 --> 06:05.573
You punk. Are you…
getting into fights now? Is that it?

06:08.242 --> 06:09.660
It's fine if you are.

06:09.744 --> 06:12.246
It's almost like
a rite of passage for guys.

06:13.039 --> 06:14.749
I've been there myself, too.

06:15.917 --> 06:17.251
It's not like that.

06:18.544 --> 06:21.506
[father] So, did you… get a good punch in?

06:21.589 --> 06:22.590
Huh?

06:27.845 --> 06:30.431
- [sighs]
- All right, I won't pry. Get rest.

06:31.140 --> 06:32.225
Must be puberty.

06:37.897 --> 06:40.066
[pensive ambient music playing]

07:12.265 --> 07:14.475
[sighs]

07:17.270 --> 07:19.564
- [boy 1] What are you doing?
- [boy 2] I told you not…

07:19.647 --> 07:21.107
[boy 2] Okay. All right, that's fine.

07:21.983 --> 07:23.985
[papers rustling]

07:28.948 --> 07:32.243
[whispering] Yeah, I think there's
something seriously wrong with…

07:39.167 --> 07:41.252
[tense music playing]

07:41.335 --> 07:42.628
[chair clatters]

07:44.964 --> 07:46.215
Hey, shitball.

07:48.593 --> 07:49.719
See me after school.

07:50.428 --> 07:53.097
[Tae-hun] You caught me off guard
yesterday, you loser.

07:53.598 --> 07:55.641
But I'll fucking kill you today.

07:57.977 --> 08:00.146
[closes book]

08:01.147 --> 08:02.273
[slams pen down]

08:02.356 --> 08:03.649
Why don't you see me now?

08:05.443 --> 08:07.361
[sighs] I am sick of this.

08:07.445 --> 08:10.323
- [Tae-hun] I can't believe this asshole.
- [boy 3] Should we follow them?

08:11.032 --> 08:12.783
Are they going to fight?

08:12.867 --> 08:15.411
- Yeah.
- Shouldn't we go stop them or something?

08:15.495 --> 08:17.663
- Let's go!
- [all murmuring]

08:17.747 --> 08:19.081
This is gonna be wild.

08:19.582 --> 08:20.583
I told you…

08:21.083 --> 08:22.877
[nervy music playing]

08:22.960 --> 08:24.712
[excited conversations continue]

08:30.968 --> 08:32.970
[Tae-hun] I owe him a teachable lesson.

08:33.846 --> 08:35.348
- [door slams]
- [music stops]

08:35.431 --> 08:36.599
[Tae-hun] Oh shit.

08:42.438 --> 08:44.398
[silence]

08:44.482 --> 08:45.608
[Si-eun] I guess

08:46.859 --> 08:48.528
you guys are pretty stupid, aren't you?

08:49.445 --> 08:52.114
- What the hell did you call us?
- Ugh. This guy.

08:54.367 --> 08:57.453
[boy 4] No, but why did he make them
follow him into the bathroom?

08:58.913 --> 09:00.790
[students gasping]

09:01.582 --> 09:02.875
[Jeong-chan] What is he doing?

09:10.174 --> 09:11.342
[Si-eun] You need a review…

09:13.970 --> 09:15.388
since your memory's bad.

09:22.687 --> 09:23.980
[clicks]

09:25.982 --> 09:27.858
[Si-eun] Pavlov's dog experiment.

09:27.942 --> 09:29.694
[suspenseful music playing]

09:31.946 --> 09:33.072
[Si-eun] Ring the bell.

09:33.155 --> 09:34.240
[pen clicks]

09:34.907 --> 09:35.992
[Si-eun] Feed the dog.

09:36.075 --> 09:36.993
[pen clicks]

09:37.076 --> 09:38.536
[Si-eun] The dog salivates.

09:41.080 --> 09:42.039
Ring the bell.

09:42.123 --> 09:43.165
[pen clicks]

09:44.000 --> 09:45.501
- [Si-eun] Feed the dog.
- [pen clicks]

09:47.378 --> 09:48.921
[Si-eun] The dog salivates.

09:52.592 --> 09:53.467
[clicks]

09:54.051 --> 09:56.596
[Si-eun] Just ring the bell.

09:57.930 --> 09:59.140
No more of this.

09:59.849 --> 10:00.850
Do me a favor.

10:02.184 --> 10:03.185
I'm asking

10:04.770 --> 10:05.730
to stop.

10:10.943 --> 10:12.111
- [music stops]
- [clicks]

10:14.864 --> 10:16.616
[Tae-hun breathing shakily]

10:16.699 --> 10:17.825
[door opens]

10:18.492 --> 10:19.619
[door closes]

10:22.371 --> 10:25.374
- What's going on with them?
- They were just standing in the bathroom.

10:25.458 --> 10:27.376
Hey, Si-eun, what happened in there?

10:27.460 --> 10:29.670
Did you show those assholes
what's up, again?

10:29.754 --> 10:31.505
- Right!
- [boy 1] Wait. Let's see what he says.

10:31.589 --> 10:32.965
I wanna hear it from his mouth.

10:35.009 --> 10:36.844
He's gonna tell us what happened.

10:36.927 --> 10:37.803
Do I know you?

10:40.222 --> 10:41.682
[boy 2] That was harsh.

10:42.308 --> 10:43.309
Are we close?

10:48.856 --> 10:50.691
- [boy 3] That was…
- [boy 4] I almost did it.

10:52.777 --> 10:55.821
Dang. He is kind of badass, though.
Not gonna lie.

11:05.831 --> 11:06.957
[sighs]

11:07.667 --> 11:09.669
[birdsong]

11:11.379 --> 11:13.464
[quiet, tense music playing]

11:24.975 --> 11:26.102
[Su-ho sighs]

11:29.021 --> 11:31.232
What's going on? Where is everybody?

11:46.497 --> 11:47.873
[PA chimes]

11:49.166 --> 11:50.793
[muffled announcement on PA]

12:05.516 --> 12:06.976
You didn't listen to what I said.

12:11.814 --> 12:12.690
What's this?

12:14.275 --> 12:15.651
[can opens]

12:15.735 --> 12:17.445
[dealer] Get a nose job,
since you're here.

12:20.865 --> 12:22.700
[quiet, menacing music playing]

12:24.285 --> 12:25.369
Who is he?

12:26.996 --> 12:28.414
Guy in my class.

12:28.497 --> 12:29.832
How much will you pay?

12:31.125 --> 12:32.293
How much do you want?

12:33.043 --> 12:35.379
[scoffs] Are you made of fucking money?

12:36.922 --> 12:39.008
I should've been your dad's son
instead of nephew.

12:45.264 --> 12:46.265
"Help me,

12:47.433 --> 12:48.434
hyeong."

12:50.644 --> 12:51.479
Say it.

12:52.396 --> 12:53.731
"Help me, hyeong."

12:53.814 --> 12:55.065
[sighs]

12:56.233 --> 12:57.234
Help me,

12:58.944 --> 12:59.945
hyeong.

13:10.039 --> 13:11.665
[horn honking]

13:21.133 --> 13:23.385
Hey! What are you doin' here?

13:23.469 --> 13:25.054
Were we married in a past life?

13:25.137 --> 13:26.639
Anyway, where are you goin'?

13:28.265 --> 13:29.308
Me? Home.

13:30.309 --> 13:31.227
What?

13:33.938 --> 13:35.022
Home.

13:35.815 --> 13:36.899
After hagwon?

13:37.650 --> 13:39.151
- Yeah.
- [Su-ho] Oh.

13:44.990 --> 13:45.991
I'm sorry.

13:46.575 --> 13:47.576
Are ya?

13:48.160 --> 13:50.329
You can buy me a meal
if you wanna apologize.

13:50.412 --> 13:52.039
Oh, the light. See you around.

13:53.624 --> 13:55.209
[motorbike accelerates away]

13:56.252 --> 13:58.254
["Home Sick" by Benzamin plays]

14:15.896 --> 14:17.106
These for me?

14:17.189 --> 14:18.190
Delivery!

14:19.650 --> 14:21.235
Hello? Delivery.

14:22.570 --> 14:23.904
[lock bleeps]

14:31.120 --> 14:32.037
[doorbell rings]

14:35.374 --> 14:36.458
Delivery.

14:36.542 --> 14:38.669
- Hey, do you want some candy?
- Yeah.

14:40.254 --> 14:41.463
Don't tell anyone. Sh!

14:42.923 --> 14:44.758
[bleeps]

14:50.556 --> 14:51.682
[bleeps]

14:51.765 --> 14:53.225
[dog barking]

14:54.602 --> 14:57.897
♪ Baby, I don't know how to go home
Now I'm sick… ♪

14:57.980 --> 14:59.607
[song continues in Korean]

15:06.572 --> 15:07.865
[sighs]

15:09.742 --> 15:13.746
BYUKSAN HIGH SCHOOL

15:13.829 --> 15:15.456
FACULTY SHOWER ROOM

15:35.309 --> 15:37.311
[Su-ho snoring]

15:55.371 --> 15:57.081
[song ends]

16:00.584 --> 16:02.044
[snoring]

16:12.888 --> 16:13.764
Hmm?

16:14.348 --> 16:16.350
- Time for lunch.
- [Su-ho sighs] Mmph.

16:17.017 --> 16:18.769
Mmm. Ah, I'm good.

16:19.269 --> 16:21.397
- [grunts]
- [Si-eun] You wanted me to treat.

16:27.361 --> 16:29.196
Why are you looking at me like that?

16:30.280 --> 16:31.281
I won't eat.

16:32.992 --> 16:34.785
[cheering and clapping outside]

16:36.286 --> 16:38.288
[quirky music playing]

16:40.290 --> 16:42.626
I wasn't asking you
to buy something expensive,

16:43.669 --> 16:45.879
but I can pay for my own school lunch.

16:46.463 --> 16:47.548
Then don't eat it.

16:50.718 --> 16:52.219
[sighs] I'll eat it.

16:58.559 --> 16:59.768
[Si-eun] By the way,

17:01.103 --> 17:02.229
why do you sleep here?

17:02.312 --> 17:04.898
Oh, I come here after my part-time job.

17:04.982 --> 17:07.192
If I went home,
I wouldn't wake up on time.

17:07.901 --> 17:10.195
My grandma said
it's okay not to go to college,

17:10.279 --> 17:13.282
but I have to have perfect attendance
and my high school diploma.

17:13.365 --> 17:14.533
[slurps]

17:15.617 --> 17:17.536
Are you music obsessed or something?

17:18.454 --> 17:20.122
You're always wearing earbuds.

17:20.205 --> 17:21.707
It's kind of rude, bro.

17:24.376 --> 17:26.211
- And convenient.
- What?

17:27.046 --> 17:29.631
It's to prevent people
from trying to talk to me.

17:30.340 --> 17:32.051
You're a freakin' weirdo, you know that?

17:32.134 --> 17:33.844
Might want to look in the mirror.

17:37.890 --> 17:39.266
[chuckling]

17:42.686 --> 17:43.896
Oh.

17:45.064 --> 17:47.733
Hey, why isn't Yeon Si-eun
getting reprimanded?

17:47.816 --> 17:51.487
I heard that Jeon Yeong-bin
was caught with fucking fentanyl.

17:51.570 --> 17:52.696
- [all gasp]
- Really?

17:52.780 --> 17:53.655
No way.

17:53.739 --> 17:56.283
It's legit. They're not punishing him
so he doesn't talk.

17:56.366 --> 17:58.660
But why all of a sudden
are they hanging out together?

17:58.744 --> 18:00.829
I don't know. Out of nowhere,
they became best friends.

18:00.913 --> 18:04.833
[boy 1] I heard Ahn Su-ho is freaking good
at MMA. He almost debuted in the AFC.

18:04.917 --> 18:07.920
[boy 2] I knew it.
His counterpunch was fucking awesome!

18:08.003 --> 18:09.046
[laughter]

18:09.129 --> 18:12.716
HERO CASINO
PURCHASE GAME MONEY

18:13.217 --> 18:17.012
PLAYER - TIE - BANKER

18:17.096 --> 18:19.306
[moody music playing]

18:24.061 --> 18:25.521
BET

18:25.604 --> 18:27.606
[chiming]

18:28.941 --> 18:30.859
LOSE

18:34.404 --> 18:36.198
[groans]

18:37.032 --> 18:38.992
[dealer] Stamp here, here, and here.

18:39.076 --> 18:39.952
PROMISSORY NOTE

18:40.786 --> 18:42.287
[papers rustling]

18:47.251 --> 18:48.836
[girl] Oh! Gucci.

18:49.545 --> 18:50.671
Nice bag.

18:51.296 --> 18:52.589
Where's the label?

18:57.136 --> 19:00.681
CREDITOR: JEON SEOK-DAE
DEBTOR: KIM WON-SEOK

19:03.892 --> 19:05.394
It's on. Awesome.

19:05.477 --> 19:08.605
When… are you gonna wire the money?

19:11.775 --> 19:12.693
Go.

19:16.238 --> 19:19.241
[associate 1] That deal went
so fucking smooth. Smooth.

19:23.162 --> 19:25.414
- [Yeong-bin] You're late.
- Yeah.

19:26.498 --> 19:27.583
I'm not sorry.

19:27.666 --> 19:28.876
[lighter clicks]

19:31.670 --> 19:33.672
- Crop this one…
- [Seok-dae] Say hi to the kids.

19:34.506 --> 19:36.258
He's my cousin.

19:36.341 --> 19:37.676
He's rich.

19:39.845 --> 19:40.971
What?

19:42.222 --> 19:43.807
What do you want?

19:44.308 --> 19:45.517
You look like shit, dude.

19:46.268 --> 19:47.102
Who, me?

19:47.186 --> 19:49.021
- [laughing]
- Man, that's fuckin' rough.

19:49.104 --> 19:50.355
- [Yeong-bin] Me?
- [girl] Asshole.

19:50.439 --> 19:52.608
- [associate 1] Fuckin' nice.
- [Yeong-bin] Anyway.

19:53.859 --> 19:54.902
[Seok-dae] Hey.

19:56.653 --> 19:57.905
When's he get out?

20:04.953 --> 20:05.954
[Beom-seok] Si-eun.

20:07.164 --> 20:08.165
Si-eun.

20:11.627 --> 20:13.545
You don't have to stay for night study?

20:13.629 --> 20:14.671
[Si-eun] Hagwon?

20:15.255 --> 20:16.757
[sighs] Yeah.

20:17.507 --> 20:19.301
[Beom-seok] Which hagwon do you go to?

20:20.344 --> 20:21.303
Daemyeong.

20:22.262 --> 20:24.890
[Beom-seok] I'm thinking about
going to a hagwon too.

20:24.973 --> 20:27.434
Do you like yours? Should I go there?

20:35.817 --> 20:37.527
You don't have to get on my good side.

20:38.528 --> 20:40.572
I won't accept your apology either.

20:50.290 --> 20:51.917
[boy 1] Let's get this over with.

20:52.417 --> 20:53.794
[boy 2] Bye! See you guys.

20:55.045 --> 20:56.338
I'll wait for you outside.

20:56.421 --> 20:58.548
- [Su-ho yells] Yah! Come on!
- [boy 3] Oh shit!

20:59.591 --> 21:01.093
[exhales] You scared me.

21:02.970 --> 21:04.680
What's going on? School's done?

21:04.763 --> 21:06.181
[boy 4 scoffs] Yeah.

21:06.265 --> 21:08.767
[Su-ho sighs] Why do you guys
have to hurt my feelings?

21:08.850 --> 21:12.187
- Nobody woke me up.
- You said for us not to.

21:12.729 --> 21:14.147
[all chuckle]

21:14.231 --> 21:15.315
I did?

21:16.525 --> 21:17.776
Can you wake me up in ten?

21:20.570 --> 21:21.613
[sighs]

21:23.448 --> 21:24.700
[birdsong]

21:30.706 --> 21:31.623
[sighs]

21:31.707 --> 21:33.709
[tense music playing]

21:51.852 --> 21:52.936
This guy?

21:53.020 --> 21:55.272
[sighs] This is bullshit.

21:55.355 --> 21:57.691
You're not embarrassed? It won't be fair.

22:04.740 --> 22:06.116
I have to go to my hagwon.

22:06.992 --> 22:08.285
Nothing personal.

22:09.661 --> 22:11.079
It's just business.

22:26.845 --> 22:29.181
- [murmuring]
- Hey, isn't that Jeon Yeong-bin?

22:29.264 --> 22:30.432
Looking for a fight.

22:30.515 --> 22:32.726
- Have you seen her before?
- Looks like it.

22:38.648 --> 22:40.067
[boy] Oh shit.

22:41.526 --> 22:43.362
[Su-ho snoring]

22:44.404 --> 22:45.864
[tense music continues]

22:49.409 --> 22:50.660
[Beom-seok] Hey, Su-ho.

22:51.661 --> 22:53.747
- [snoring]
- Ahn Su-ho.

22:56.041 --> 22:58.585
That asshole Yeong-bin
took Si-eun somewhere.

22:58.668 --> 23:00.045
[sighs] What?

23:00.629 --> 23:04.174
- I said Yeong-bin took Si-eun somewhere.
- Yeah, and?

23:04.966 --> 23:07.677
What? You should help him, Su-ho.

23:08.303 --> 23:09.262
Don't you think so?

23:09.846 --> 23:11.264
Didn't you do martial arts?

23:12.349 --> 23:14.267
We're not really that close, you know.

23:15.727 --> 23:18.021
Okay, but how close
do you have to be to help him?

23:18.105 --> 23:21.650
[yawns] Go tell the homeroom teacher
to help him. I have work.

23:22.401 --> 23:24.486
- [grunts]
- How about if I pay you?

23:29.282 --> 23:30.534
I'll pay you double.

23:40.419 --> 23:42.087
My pleasure. All right.

23:42.170 --> 23:43.713
[upbeat pop music playing]

23:43.797 --> 23:46.174
[Su-ho] At your service. Let's go.

23:46.258 --> 23:47.259
[bleeping]

23:51.012 --> 23:52.514
Get on! Here.

24:02.816 --> 24:04.067
Keep an eye out.

24:15.328 --> 24:16.705
[music stops]

24:20.041 --> 24:21.251
[lighter clicks]

24:27.090 --> 24:28.592
Yeong-i, go keep watch.

24:30.051 --> 24:31.386
Wow.

24:32.554 --> 24:34.347
I'm seriously bored out of my mind.

24:34.931 --> 24:36.683
You're acting like a bunch of kids.

24:37.267 --> 24:39.519
Gil-su's calling. Be quick.

24:40.187 --> 24:42.355
[scoffs] So stupid.

24:47.777 --> 24:48.862
[Yeong-bin] His hands.

24:51.656 --> 24:53.158
Break his hands into pieces.

24:53.825 --> 24:55.327
He'll never study again.

24:56.578 --> 24:57.996
[tense music playing]

24:58.079 --> 25:01.082
[Si-eun] Three on the left.
Take care of them first.

25:02.250 --> 25:04.669
Two on the right move
on conditioned reflex. Handle them later.

25:13.094 --> 25:15.805
I have to get a head start.

25:15.889 --> 25:17.432
Let's get it over with.

25:21.311 --> 25:22.145
Nice try.

25:24.105 --> 25:25.273
- [Seok-dae] Whoa!
- Oh shit.

25:28.068 --> 25:29.361
[yelping]

25:29.444 --> 25:30.737
[groaning]

25:30.820 --> 25:32.030
You fuck…

25:33.949 --> 25:35.325
[associate 1 yells]

25:39.496 --> 25:40.872
[yelps]

25:40.956 --> 25:41.790
[Si-eun grunts]

25:45.627 --> 25:46.753
[associate 2 grunts]

25:47.671 --> 25:48.672
Eat shit.

25:49.297 --> 25:50.382
[grunts]

25:50.966 --> 25:52.050
[yells]

25:53.093 --> 25:54.553
[music stops]

25:54.636 --> 25:56.429
[all sighing and groaning]

25:57.514 --> 25:59.641
[associate 2] Oh shit. [grunts]

26:00.350 --> 26:01.309
[sighs]

26:10.694 --> 26:11.736
Move it.

26:13.363 --> 26:14.573
[both sigh]

26:17.492 --> 26:18.451
Hey.

26:20.161 --> 26:21.371
[tense music playing]

26:30.797 --> 26:31.673
[Seok-dae] My bad.

26:31.756 --> 26:33.049
I thought you were weak.

26:33.800 --> 26:35.260
[running footsteps]

26:36.261 --> 26:37.679
Hey, get out of my way.

26:38.972 --> 26:42.183
You asshole! Fuck you, bro.
Fuck you! Shithead!

26:42.267 --> 26:44.894
Psycho! You staring fucking psycho!

26:44.978 --> 26:47.105
Fuck you, you… Fuck! Fuck!

26:47.188 --> 26:48.565
Fuck! Fucker!

26:49.774 --> 26:52.152
Hey, come grab his hand.

26:52.861 --> 26:54.404
Let's fuck him up.

26:55.280 --> 26:56.865
- Come here.
- [Si-eun panting]

26:57.866 --> 26:59.701
[Tae-hun] You can't leave, shithead.

27:00.410 --> 27:01.286
Not yet.

27:02.203 --> 27:03.538
Happy studying!

27:03.622 --> 27:04.581
[Si-eun groaning]

27:07.792 --> 27:08.793
[laughs]

27:08.877 --> 27:10.253
Know your place, asshole.

27:10.337 --> 27:12.547
You shouldn't have even
messed with me, you shithead.

27:15.175 --> 27:16.843
[running footsteps]

27:19.888 --> 27:21.890
[panting] Should you?

27:26.895 --> 27:28.605
- Whoo!
- [Jeong-chan] You okay, Yeong-bin-a?

27:29.189 --> 27:31.024
- [associate 2] Who the hell is that?
- [coughing]

27:31.107 --> 27:32.192
[associate 1] No idea, dude.

27:33.026 --> 27:34.110
Are you okay?

27:34.778 --> 27:36.029
[Si-eun gasping]

27:38.490 --> 27:39.949
Ugh. My arm hurts.

27:50.710 --> 27:53.254
You can stop now. Okay?

28:03.223 --> 28:05.225
[menacing music playing]

28:06.393 --> 28:07.394
[Seok-dae] Hey.

28:08.061 --> 28:09.020
[Su-ho] Oh!

28:24.536 --> 28:25.537
[Seok-dae] Asshole.

28:33.128 --> 28:36.172
Hey. Go get that fucking bitch.

28:44.305 --> 28:45.390
[Tae-hun] You bitch!

28:46.224 --> 28:47.434
You're sick!

28:51.438 --> 28:52.772
Die, motherfucker!

29:20.133 --> 29:21.801
- [Su-ho] Tap out already.
- [Seok-dae grunts]

29:21.885 --> 29:24.554
- [Su-ho] Otherwise you're gonna die.
- [Yeong-bin] Hey, move!

29:24.637 --> 29:25.847
My shit…

29:25.930 --> 29:26.931
Fucker!

29:30.727 --> 29:31.811
[Su-ho grunts]

29:32.812 --> 29:34.230
[Seok-dae groans]

29:39.569 --> 29:41.488
- Hey!
- [grunts]

29:52.916 --> 29:54.000
On your--

29:54.083 --> 29:55.043
- [thud]
- [music stops]

29:55.126 --> 29:57.128
- [Yeong-bin groans]
- [bottle clatters]

29:58.087 --> 29:59.714
[all panting]

30:01.132 --> 30:02.383
Oh shit.

30:08.306 --> 30:10.892
- Shithead.
- [Seok-dae] Nice hit, bro.

30:12.352 --> 30:13.520
[Su-ho] Hah!

30:16.439 --> 30:17.857
All you guys,

30:17.941 --> 30:20.151
aren't you embarrassed
about ganging up on him?

30:22.028 --> 30:24.572
If it were me, I'd die of humiliation.

30:31.162 --> 30:32.121
[Yeong-bin] Hyeong.

30:33.039 --> 30:34.040
What's up?

30:36.459 --> 30:39.212
- What's next?
- [sighs] Hi there.

30:40.713 --> 30:41.923
[sighs]

30:42.006 --> 30:42.924
[Seok-dae sighs]

30:43.007 --> 30:44.926
[Su-ho] Your hyeong must be embarrassed.

30:46.594 --> 30:47.679
[Seok-dae sighs]

30:48.888 --> 30:50.139
Let's call it a day.

30:52.350 --> 30:53.726
Look, he's leaving.

30:55.311 --> 30:57.272
[Yeong-i] Hey, Gil-su called.

31:00.692 --> 31:02.527
- [scoffs]
- [associate 1] Hey, let's go.

31:02.610 --> 31:04.028
- [Yeong-i grunts]
- Ow.

31:04.112 --> 31:06.030
- [Yeong-i] Huh? Huh?
- [associate 2 sighs]

31:09.033 --> 31:10.159
[Si-eun] Jeon Yeong-bin.

31:11.327 --> 31:12.245
Enough.

31:17.584 --> 31:18.585
Just stop.

31:22.589 --> 31:23.631
[sighs]

31:27.260 --> 31:28.261
[Su-ho] Let's go.

31:34.601 --> 31:36.144
- Ah. Ooh.
- [Beom-seok] You okay?

31:36.936 --> 31:38.187
[Su-ho] Let me see.

31:38.271 --> 31:40.231
- You're pretty scraped up, huh?
- [Si-eun] Stop.

31:46.779 --> 31:47.989
[yawns]

31:48.489 --> 31:51.034
Aah, I'm hungry after doing all that.

31:51.993 --> 31:54.913
Let's go eat.
I know an awesome place we can go.

31:56.623 --> 31:59.042
Time to pay your bill. Hmm?

32:04.464 --> 32:06.007
[bleeping]

32:06.090 --> 32:07.550
[starts engine]

32:09.135 --> 32:10.637
What? Hop on.

32:11.763 --> 32:14.057
- I have hagwon.
- [Su-ho] Come on.

32:14.140 --> 32:18.186
We came to your rescue. That's all we get?
You're not even going to thank us?

32:19.729 --> 32:21.397
This place is really good.

32:33.576 --> 32:34.577
[sighs]

32:34.661 --> 32:36.079
[sizzling]

32:38.331 --> 32:39.666
[cutlery scraping]

32:45.088 --> 32:47.423
It's on me today. Really.

32:47.507 --> 32:48.758
I'm sorry I'm late, Emo.

32:48.841 --> 32:50.677
[Emo] You're here. You're very late.

32:51.177 --> 32:52.428
- [Su-ho] Yes.
- [Emo] Did you eat?

32:52.512 --> 32:55.556
- [Su-ho] I'll eat later. Okay?
- [Emo] You must've had a tough day.

32:57.809 --> 33:01.104
Hey, I'm late because of you guys.
So help out.

33:01.604 --> 33:04.399
- [Emo] Are these your friends?
- Uh-huh. Oh, hello.

33:04.482 --> 33:06.442
[country music playing]

33:10.363 --> 33:12.824
[Su-ho] Hey, make sure
you make it sparkle, okay?

33:14.367 --> 33:17.370
[Emo] Oh! You're so thorough
at washing dishes!

33:17.453 --> 33:21.165
Your mom must adore you.
You're such a wonderful boy. [chuckles]

33:27.255 --> 33:28.798
[Su-ho] Hey, grab the last box.

33:29.882 --> 33:31.884
[man] It's okay. It's okay.

33:32.510 --> 33:33.469
I got it.

33:34.595 --> 33:36.889
- Do you work two jobs every day?
- [Su-ho] What?

33:38.808 --> 33:40.643
I only deliver food three days a week.

33:40.727 --> 33:41.728
Not every day.

33:44.731 --> 33:45.606
Isn't it hard?

33:48.609 --> 33:51.988
It's no big deal.
I work for a moving company on weekends.

33:52.071 --> 33:54.657
[man] Dude, no. Milk and ham go together.

33:56.451 --> 33:57.326
[Su-ho] Why?

33:59.495 --> 34:01.497
Do I seem too mature to you? Or what?

34:02.540 --> 34:03.624
- [chuckles]
- [chairs scrape]

34:04.250 --> 34:05.752
[Su-ho] Oh, hello, welcome. Yes.

34:06.377 --> 34:07.336
Finish the rest.

34:08.713 --> 34:10.673
What can I get you?
Take your time and let me know.

34:14.761 --> 34:16.512
[man] Hey, can we get some more glasses?

34:25.396 --> 34:26.564
[Beom-seok clears throat]

34:29.358 --> 34:30.359
Um…

34:32.737 --> 34:34.822
Um, about the mock test.

34:36.074 --> 34:38.493
I'm, uh… I'm sorry.

34:39.118 --> 34:41.704
Uh… Jeon Yeong-bin threatened me.

34:43.539 --> 34:46.334
I had no idea that it was… what it was.

34:50.088 --> 34:51.214
I know.

34:51.839 --> 34:52.840
It's fine.

34:58.137 --> 34:59.097
Mmm.

34:59.597 --> 35:01.265
[Su-ho] Aah, I'm starving.

35:01.349 --> 35:02.600
- [Si-eun]Yeah.
- [Su-ho] Aah!

35:11.317 --> 35:12.443
Mmm!

35:16.989 --> 35:19.200
- Mmm.
- Is it better that way?

35:19.283 --> 35:20.368
Mmm.

35:22.078 --> 35:23.371
I'll try it.

35:31.295 --> 35:32.505
[chuckles]

35:32.588 --> 35:35.633
- It's killer, yeah?
- [Beom-seok, mouth full] It's hot.

35:35.716 --> 35:37.718
So hot. [laughs]

35:41.055 --> 35:43.057
[upbeat music playing]

35:44.433 --> 35:47.603
[Su-ho] Well, dear Si-eun-ssi, wanna try?

35:49.063 --> 35:52.525
Meat's always better when you stuff
your mouth and eat it in one bite.

35:54.110 --> 35:55.027
You can have it.

35:56.028 --> 35:56.904
Aw.

35:57.488 --> 36:00.741
Hey. No one's ever lost anything
from listening to me.

36:00.825 --> 36:02.076
So come on now.

36:02.577 --> 36:04.287
Mmm? "Aah."

36:06.539 --> 36:07.665
Are your hands clean?

36:08.457 --> 36:09.709
What the…

36:10.293 --> 36:13.921
This guy has no idea.
Food tastes better this way. All right?

36:14.881 --> 36:17.258
It's okay. "Aah. Aah!"

36:17.341 --> 36:18.843
Yeah? "Aah!"

36:18.926 --> 36:19.927
[Si-eun] Ah.

36:20.469 --> 36:21.762
[Su-ho] "Aah!"

36:24.557 --> 36:26.517
It's good? Awesome, right?

36:27.101 --> 36:28.269
[chuckles]

36:29.187 --> 36:30.104
Right?

36:31.147 --> 36:32.398
[chuckles]

36:34.317 --> 36:36.194
- [Beom-seok] This meat is amazing.
- [Su-ho] See?

36:36.277 --> 36:37.778
- Come whenever.
- [phone buzzes]

36:37.862 --> 36:39.488
- [Beom-seok] Can I really?
- [Su-ho] Yeah.

36:42.200 --> 36:43.409
[music fades]

36:44.035 --> 36:47.622
FATHER: WHERE ARE YOU?
DIDN'T YOU GO TO NIGHT STUDY?

36:47.705 --> 36:49.332
[man] Uh-huh. How are yours?

37:11.354 --> 37:14.565
SU-HO, THAT WAS SO TASTY
LET'S GO AGAIN SOMETIME

37:16.609 --> 37:22.657
SU-HO, FOLLOW ME BACK ON INSTAGRAM

37:23.407 --> 37:25.785
[knuckles cracking]

37:33.709 --> 37:35.336
[pop music playing on video]

37:35.419 --> 37:38.005
[man on video] There are many people
who take on a challenging job,

37:38.089 --> 37:40.883
only to quit soon after
because it doesn't suit them.

37:40.967 --> 37:43.386
Don't get too caught up
in your credentials.

37:43.469 --> 37:45.930
If you continue to work
hard in your field,

37:46.013 --> 37:50.101
I know that you'll find many opportunities
to make money here in Korea.

37:50.184 --> 37:51.143
DELIVERY ORDER

37:51.227 --> 37:53.479
I'm in the real estate industry right now,
but if I--

37:53.562 --> 37:54.605
[stops video]

37:55.189 --> 37:56.190
[sighs]

38:00.569 --> 38:01.654
[grunts]

38:02.363 --> 38:05.825
[Si-eun's mother] Next, why don't we talk
about indefinite equations?

38:05.908 --> 38:10.329
Indefinite equations are
the very core of all advanced mathematics.

38:10.413 --> 38:14.125
This concept is primarily used
across all of mathematics' areas,

38:14.208 --> 38:16.377
so we'll be going over it in detail today.

38:16.919 --> 38:18.879
Now, indefinite equations.

38:18.963 --> 38:22.174
What exactly do we call
an indefinite equation?

38:22.258 --> 38:27.179
"In" and "definite." These together
mean an undetermined equation.

38:27.680 --> 38:29.223
Why is it undetermined?

38:29.307 --> 38:32.852
Well, that's because
there are multiple possible answers,

38:32.935 --> 38:37.315
and it is difficult to point to one
of them and know, "This is the answer."

38:37.398 --> 38:40.818
So let's try to define
this indefinite equation mathematically.

38:40.901 --> 38:44.572
When we compare the number of unknowns
and the number of equations,

38:44.655 --> 38:48.367
the number of unknowns is
greater than the number of equations,

38:48.451 --> 38:50.453
which leads us to know that…

38:50.536 --> 38:52.538
[gentle, pensive music playing]

38:56.542 --> 38:57.668
[man] Hey, fucker.

38:57.752 --> 38:59.253
[music slows]

38:59.962 --> 39:01.005
[man] Who was it?

39:05.259 --> 39:07.261
[music becomes dramatic]

39:15.770 --> 39:17.772
[moody electronic music playing]

41:46.921 --> 41:48.589
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS
ARE FICTIONAL

41:48.672 --> 41:50.299
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL
